bruce@Software.Mitel.COM (Bruce Clement) writes:

>...
>Can you sell things to the shopkeeper and if so how
>do you do it?  ...

You sell things to a shopkeeper automatically by dropping them while
in the shop.  If the shopkeeper is interested, you will be paid for the
item/items you wish to sell.   Try it and see!

>... Also of what use are statues?

Statues have two uses.  (As usual, spoilers ahead!)

1.  You can wield them to #force open locked chests and boxes, without
    damaging any of your real weapons.  You can also bash monsters with
    them, but other weapons are usually better.

2.  You can apply a pick-axe to them.  Some of them may contain spellbooks.
